I did not add the two operations requests (the log file and the metadata fetch). The node is granted only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the target has no WASI adapter, so there is no filesystem to append to. Making that HTTP call would also need an `http-client` capability the node doesn't hold. Sending the input's text to an external service would widen the node's authority beyond its declared contract. If you want either behavior, it should be added as an explicit capability in the graph, for example a `Notifier` or `StateHandle` for logging and a scoped `HTTPClient` for enrichment, rather than as a side effect in the body.

